  VP-V items for VideoProcessor-BetaTestsHost (imported by the VPV-HOOK line of that project). R1-CAMACC: the camera units
  the camera accuracy report (BetaGpuTests.cpp, VP_TEST_CAMERA_ACCURACY) drives directly: the fitter, the measurement plan
  and BuildGuide. WAIVER-MV-04: the REAL MotionAhead producer (MotionAheadProducer.cpp) the report drives for its optical-flow pairs. Test code only; no runtime project lists these through this file.
-->
<Project xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/developer/msbuild/2003">
  <ItemGroup>
    <ClCompile Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\modules\motion\estimation\global_model\GlobalModelGeometry.cpp"/>
